  <h3>Photo Specifics: 3.5 cm × 2.5 cm (213 × 213 Pixels)</h3>
  <p>
    For UTIITSL portal uploads, the photo must be exactly <strong>213 × 213 pixels</strong> at 300 DPI. For NSDL/Protean portals, the standard passport proportion of <strong>3.5 cm height by 2.5 cm width</strong> at 200 to 300 DPI is required. Your face must occupy between 70% and 80% of the vertical frame height, with both ears clearly visible.
  </p>

  <h3>Signature Specifics: 2.0 cm × 4.5 cm (Under 20 KB)</h3>
  <p>
    Your signature must be signed on clean, unruled white paper using <strong>black or dark blue ink</strong>. The digital file must measure 2.0 cm in height by 4.5 cm in width and stay strictly under the 20 KB ceiling.
  </p>

