  <h3>Top Mistakes Leading to Rejection</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <strong>Uploading Selfies with Angled Cameras:</strong> Selfies taken from high or low angles distort facial proportions. Always have someone take the photo from eye level or use a tripod.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Shadows on Face or Background:</strong> Harsh flash shadows cast against the wall behind your head will fail automated background checks. Use diffused, front-facing lighting.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Blurry Signature Scans:</strong> Signatures scanned in low resolution or captured in dim lighting look grey and fuzzy, leading to signature mismatch notices.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Cropping Too Close to the Face:</strong> Leaving zero margin around your hair or chin causes automated cropping tools to slice your head during PVC printing.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Uploading in Wrong File Formats:</strong> Attempting to upload PNG or PDF files where the portal explicitly demands JPG/JPEG causes immediate upload failure.
    </li>
  </ol>

